TASK-260720-q5oy3o,task,protocol-rc4-release-metadata,Publish protocol 1.0.0-rc.4 release metadata,backlog,STORY-260720-35dck7,,"Update release-facing metadata for the schema 6 protocol candidate. Record the reader and writer compatibility transition, security impact, new conformance identity, and release gates without claiming that downstream implementations or releases exist before their real commits land.","Work in curator-spec after validation gates and authoring documentation. Own README.md, COMPATIBILITY.md, CHANGELOG.md, and RELEASE.md plus only version metadata directly contained in those files. Set protocol version to 1.0.0-rc.4 and the actual change date. Reference claim v2 and the generated rc.4 suite. Do not change implementation pins, fabricate review acceptance, tag state, checksums, signatures, attestations, or released manager versions.","README identifies 1.0.0-rc.4 and indexes schema 6, marker v2, receipt v1, claim v2, and the compile-only decision; COMPATIBILITY gives an explicit reader and writer matrix for schemas 1 through 6, marker v1 and v2, claim v1 rc.3 and claim v2 rc.4, unsupported old readers, and no migration requirement for existing schema 1 through 5 packages; CHANGELOG records declarative go-v1 builds, context exclusion, dry-run and transaction rules, conformance additions, and security tradeoffs; RELEASE adds rc.4 validation, deterministic regeneration, claim, decision, and interoperability prerequisites without marking unmet evidence complete; version strings agree with conformance manifest and claim v2; make validate and make regenerate-check pass.",[],[],[],,2026-07-20T01:44:32Z,2026-07-20T01:44:32Z,false,[],[],[]
TASK-260720-wajgn8,task,manifest-v6-schemas,Add canonical and legacy manifest schema v6,backlog,STORY-260720-35dck7,,"Introduce strict manifest schema version 6 for both agent-skill.json and the legacy csk-skill.json read alias. Reuse existing script and system command definitions, add a separate v6-only build command union, and expose build_roots only in version 6 so older manifests continue to reject the new surface.","Work in curator-spec origin/main commit 57c1f56846d221ecc55786bd3c2467ec32f11730. Own schemas/v1/common.schema.json, new schemas/v1/agent-skill-v6.schema.json, and new schemas/v1/csk-skill-v6.schema.json. Add buildCommandV6, commandV6, and the shared structural definitions needed by the manifest. Do not broaden or redefine the existing common command used by schemas 1 through 5. Semantic filesystem and Go rules remain in protocol prose and vectors.","agent-skill-v6 and csk-skill-v6 require schema_version 6 and preserve the v5 capabilities and dependencies shape; build_roots is a unique portable path set available only in v6; commandV6 accepts existing strict script and system objects plus exactly type build, driver go-v1, and source_dir; additionalProperties false rejects args, env, flags, tags, output, toolchain, scripts, hooks, and mixed command shapes; canonical and legacy schemas differ only in stable id and title naming; schemas 1 through 5 and their common command definition are byte-semantically unchanged and continue rejecting build_roots and type build; python3 tools/validate.py passes with temporary direct schema probes for valid and invalid v6 examples.",[],[],[],,2026-07-20T01:44:31Z,2026-07-20T01:44:31Z,false,[],[],[]
