+- `task-board m set_status(...)` succeeded for `STORY-260720-35dck7`.
+- `git` inspection succeeded for both `curator` and `curator-spec`.
+- `curator-spec` local `origin/main` and remote `refs/heads/main` both resolve to `57c1f56846d221ecc55786bd3c2467ec32f11730`.
+- System `plantuml` is absent. The Homebrew `dot` binary is currently unusable because `libltdl.7.dylib` is missing, so diagrams use a task-local PlantUML JAR and the internal Smetana layout engine.
+- Task-local PlantUML `1.2026.6` passed `-checkonly` for both sources and rendered SVG and PNG artifacts successfully; both PNGs were visually inspected.
